---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout>
    <section>
        <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto md:px-12 lg:px-32 max-w-7xl lg:pb-24">
            <div class="text-center">
                <h1
                    class="text-5xl font-semibold font-display text-blue-950 sm:text-6xl text-balance w-3/4 mx-auto">
                    What is OnTrack? 
                </h1>
                <p>MATTER stands for …. MATTER is a student-centred pedagogy built around the concepts of assessment as learning, iterative formative feedback loops, and mastery learning. It gives students agency in their learning and guarantees educational standards.  
</p><p>MATTER draws on:<ul><li>outcome-based learning, where tasks are explicitly aligned to clear learning objectives and grade levels, 
</li> learning, in which students receive iterative feedback and multiple opportunities to demonstrate competency before progressing. 
</li></ul></p>
            </div>
            
            Coming soon...
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
